# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party data is NEVER redistributed from this repository.
# WESAD is distributed under a EULA that prohibits redistribution; the Nurse and
# PhysioNet corpora contain participant-level survey and demographic rows.
# Obtain each dataset from its original source (see README, "Data and licences").
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/README.md

# Agent/QA working evidence: contains local absolute paths and usernames.
.omo/

# Peer-review correspondence is confidential until the journal and the reviewers
# agree to publish it. Re-add after acceptance if permission is granted.
revision/review*.txt
revision/**/reviews/
revision/**/response_to_reviewers.md
revision/**/major_revision_matrix.md

# The frozen 2026-06-30 submission snapshot is kept locally for provenance but
# not published: it is superseded by the current revision, and publishing two
# manuscript versions invites readers to cite the wrong one. It also still
# carries the first author's personal e-mail in both the .tex and the .pdf.
revision/MDPI_Healthcare_submission_20260630/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# LaTeX build products (the committed PDF is the authoritative build)
*.aux
*.bbl-backup
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
